WEBVTT

00:00:00.860 --> 00:00:04.460
The report states that the plant 
was completely devastated,

00:00:04.460 --> 00:00:09.230
and it appears the Imperial Army have stolen 
the new chrars that was being tested there.

00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:11.470
We appreciate your efforts.

00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:14.760
Finish your inspection, 
then return to the carrier.

00:00:14.760 --> 00:00:15.410
Yes, sir.

00:00:16.640 --> 00:00:18.850
Things are looking very bad.

00:00:18.850 --> 00:00:20.610
What are you going to do about it?

00:00:20.610 --> 00:00:22.790
The issue certainly a cause for concern,

00:00:23.240 --> 00:00:27.600
but it will take some time 
before the Grandiga Empire

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:29.770
can use the new chrars in combat.

00:00:29.770 --> 00:00:34.800
The greater threat at the moment, 
is the main enemy force that sacked Lorgeth.

00:00:36.650 --> 00:00:39.230
I expect them to attack 
the moment they're organized.

00:00:39.660 --> 00:00:41.640
We'll need to be ready to meet them.

00:00:45.680 --> 00:00:47.430
I tried to make our case, but...

00:00:47.430 --> 00:00:50.970
how do we oppose such materiel superiority?

00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:55.820
We've produced 40 new chrars 
for the flagship's knights.

00:00:56.260 --> 00:00:57.880
They'd let us put up a decent fight,

00:00:57.880 --> 00:01:02.050
if Princess Yuki would 
approve their installation.

00:01:03.570 --> 00:01:06.500
Understood. I'll speak with her about it.

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:09.270
We'd like to speak with her 
ourselves, if possible.

00:01:09.270 --> 00:01:11.470
That won't be possible just yet.

00:01:12.290 --> 00:01:13.600
How is she?

00:01:15.250 --> 00:01:18.510
She is not as distraught as she was...

00:01:19.200 --> 00:01:22.260
but I believe she'll need more time yet.

00:01:42.080 --> 00:01:44.160
The Price of Smiles

00:01:42.080 --> 00:01:44.160
<i>The Price of Smiles</i>

00:02:58.780 --> 00:03:04.450
<b><i>The Choice of Hope</i></b>

00:03:03.980 --> 00:03:06.810
<i>Hey, it's time to go. Better get ready!</i>

00:03:18.310 --> 00:03:22.300
He said... he'd look up 
how I should raise you...

00:03:23.160 --> 00:03:24.190
Princess Yuki.

00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:28.850
The enemy's main force has begun its 
invasion of the State of Caldarth.

00:03:30.040 --> 00:03:34.360
The Order and the local forces 
are moving to intercept them.

00:03:34.710 --> 00:03:36.610
I don't want to be part of this.

00:03:36.610 --> 00:03:40.590
But just slowing their advance has 
strained our forces to their limit—

00:03:40.590 --> 00:03:42.360
I don't want to hear it!

00:03:42.530 --> 00:03:45.850
You didn't tell me anything 
back then! Why now?!

00:03:45.850 --> 00:03:48.220
You even lied about the delegation!

00:03:48.220 --> 00:03:50.930
You and Izana and Harold...

00:03:51.630 --> 00:03:52.870
And Joshua...

00:03:53.270 --> 00:03:56.380
We were attempting to protect you.

00:03:56.770 --> 00:04:00.110
If I'd known, I never 
would have let Joshua go.

00:04:01.020 --> 00:04:04.650
I don't want anyone else 
to die because of me.

00:04:04.650 --> 00:04:06.890
I'll let Izana and Harold handle everything.

00:04:07.100 --> 00:04:10.810
Then will you allow them
 to install the new chrars?

00:04:10.980 --> 00:04:13.640
Those aren't supposed to be used for war!

00:04:14.230 --> 00:04:16.640
Putting them in theurgears is the reason...

00:04:17.480 --> 00:04:18.740
The reason that Joshua...

00:04:21.410 --> 00:04:26.510
Just please... don't let anyone else... die.

00:04:27.160 --> 00:04:30.660
<b>Central Soleil  Caldarth Front</b>

00:04:36.350 --> 00:04:38.310
I'll keep it all safe.

00:04:38.310 --> 00:04:41.420
Joshua would be disappointed in me otherwise.

00:04:41.960 --> 00:04:46.300
The Central Caldarth Area Army will 
engage their main force shortly.

00:04:46.500 --> 00:04:51.930
Enemy advances reported from Diatoth 
in the east and O'Lissetta in the west.

00:04:52.400 --> 00:04:54.950
Deploy two Order brigades towards each.

00:04:54.950 --> 00:04:57.360
Have them join with local 
forces to drive them back.

00:04:57.360 --> 00:04:58.190
Roger!

00:04:58.540 --> 00:04:59.820
A three-pronged attack?

00:05:01.940 --> 00:05:05.820
The Central Caldarth Area Army 
is currently in combat.

00:05:05.820 --> 00:05:09.580
The Diatoth and O'Lissetta Area Armies

00:05:09.810 --> 00:05:13.300
are expected to meet the enemy in three days.

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:16.830
This is the O'Lissetta Area Army.

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:19.340
<b>Western Soleil  O'Lissetta Front</b>

00:05:16.830 --> 00:05:19.340
We'll engage the Imperial Army shortly.

00:05:19.660 --> 00:05:22.820
I hope Yuni doesn't push herself too hard...

00:05:22.820 --> 00:05:25.340
She always tries to shoulder 
everything herself...

00:05:27.090 --> 00:05:30.720
<b>Eastern Soleil  Diatoth Front</b>

00:05:27.410 --> 00:05:30.110
The Diatoth Area Army is engaging the enemy!

00:05:34.980 --> 00:05:36.080
Joshua...

00:05:36.550 --> 00:05:39.220
What should I do?

00:05:40.260 --> 00:05:44.440
The Central Caldarth Area Army 
is in a deadlock. No movement.

00:05:45.030 --> 00:05:46.670
Dragging into day seven, then?

00:05:47.120 --> 00:05:48.910
What about O'Lissetta and Diatoth?

00:05:48.910 --> 00:05:51.070
After crushing the 
Imperial Army's sixth wave,

00:05:51.070 --> 00:05:56.270
the O'Lissetta front has remained
 locked up for 48 hours.

00:05:56.270 --> 00:06:00.410
There's been no movement 
on the Diatoth front for 20 hours.

00:06:00.410 --> 00:06:01.320
I see...

00:06:01.690 --> 00:06:04.670
Harold, you can't keep 
this up. You need sleep.

00:06:05.050 --> 00:06:06.440
I'll be fine.

00:06:06.440 --> 00:06:08.680
Urgent report from the Diatoth Area!

00:06:08.960 --> 00:06:12.050
The Imperial Army has ambushed them! 
They're exchanging fire now!

00:06:19.290 --> 00:06:22.110
Captain, a communication 
from Grand Master Harold.

00:06:22.110 --> 00:06:22.980
Put it through.

00:06:23.480 --> 00:06:25.870
<i>James. How are things there?</i>

00:06:25.870 --> 00:06:28.740
I expect they're badly depleted by now,

00:06:29.070 --> 00:06:31.170
but we're faring even worse.

00:06:31.170 --> 00:06:33.270
<i>I have more bad news.</i>

00:06:33.270 --> 00:06:35.200
<i>The line's been breached at Diatoth.</i>

00:06:35.770 --> 00:06:38.210
<i>You're about to be flanked.</i>

00:06:38.210 --> 00:06:39.600
<i>We need to avoid that at all costs.</i>

00:06:40.070 --> 00:06:40.960
What should we do?

00:06:41.700 --> 00:06:45.960
You'll have to pull back to the 
state border and regroup there.

00:06:47.010 --> 00:06:50.720
<i>I'm going to advise Princess Yuki 
to abandon the State of Caldarth.</i>

00:06:52.090 --> 00:06:56.100
<i>I'd like you to buy time for 
the state's civilians to evacuate.</i>

00:06:56.820 --> 00:06:58.060
What about O'Lissetta?

00:06:58.790 --> 00:07:01.310
<i>Send them the Gigarth Unit as backup.</i>

00:07:01.890 --> 00:07:05.470
<i>If they breach the line there, too, 
we'll be completely out of options.</i>

00:07:07.260 --> 00:07:08.100
Harold.

00:07:09.140 --> 00:07:10.840
You're aware that, in their present condition,

00:07:10.840 --> 00:07:16.130
our forces can't buy enough time 
to evacuate everyone in the state.

00:07:16.130 --> 00:07:18.220
James knows that, too.

00:07:18.580 --> 00:07:20.580
But we still have to try.

00:07:21.180 --> 00:07:23.620
We should install the new chrars.

00:07:24.410 --> 00:07:25.460
What are you—

00:07:26.170 --> 00:07:27.960
I'll share the responsibility.

00:07:30.370 --> 00:07:33.180
Abandon... the State of Caldarth?

00:07:33.180 --> 00:07:37.840
Our dead on the northern front 
number approximately 15,000.

00:07:37.840 --> 00:07:42.110
A continued struggle will 
simply add to the casualties.

00:07:42.110 --> 00:07:43.230
That's awful...

00:07:43.670 --> 00:07:48.980
Lord Harold and Lord Izana are doing all 
they can to keep losses to a minimum.

00:07:49.170 --> 00:07:50.660
I know that!

00:07:51.180 --> 00:07:52.760
I know that, but...

00:07:55.040 --> 00:07:59.730
This is a list of cities that we'll lose 
if we abandon the State of Caldarth.

00:08:01.660 --> 00:08:04.630
Please check them over and 
grant approval, if you wish.

00:08:07.600 --> 00:08:10.160
It includes the border city, Leash?

00:08:10.530 --> 00:08:11.380
Yes.

00:08:17.620 --> 00:08:19.390
That's the city of Leash.

00:08:20.460 --> 00:08:24.280
It's where the accident with the new 
chrars took place six years ago.

00:08:24.820 --> 00:08:27.820
So that's where Mother and Father...

00:08:28.170 --> 00:08:28.980
Yeah.

00:08:29.400 --> 00:08:33.070
But to help wipe away the bad memories,

00:08:33.070 --> 00:08:37.490
everyone in the country worked together 
to build a city and a memorial there.

00:08:38.540 --> 00:08:43.070
So the dream of the king and queen 
will remain there, now and forever.

00:08:43.560 --> 00:08:45.850
Their dream, to make everyone smile!

00:08:47.060 --> 00:08:49.960
To make... everyone smile?

00:08:50.780 --> 00:08:54.690
I think you might see that 
dream through some day, Yuki.

00:08:55.720 --> 00:08:56.840
Really?

00:08:56.840 --> 00:08:57.510
Yeah!

00:08:57.510 --> 00:09:00.720
And I'll be keeping you safe until you do!

00:09:03.770 --> 00:09:04.560
Okay!

00:09:10.680 --> 00:09:15.120
But... if I do this, it will 
save a lot of people, right?

00:09:15.120 --> 00:09:17.990
It will allow us to avoid a 
pointless battle, at least.

00:09:21.990 --> 00:09:23.260
I understand.

00:09:23.760 --> 00:09:27.430
I approve the abandonment 
of the State of Caldarth.

00:09:37.350 --> 00:09:38.510
I understand.

00:09:39.290 --> 00:09:42.350
Leash is important to you, Princess Yuki.

00:09:43.120 --> 00:09:46.210
<i>And... to me, too...</i>

00:09:47.470 --> 00:09:51.540
<i>Twelve years ago, scientists 
from Soleil and Grandiga</i>

00:09:51.540 --> 00:09:54.860
<i>worked together to develop the new chrars.</i>

00:09:55.430 --> 00:09:57.950
At last, the moment has come.

00:09:57.950 --> 00:10:04.960
The undying passion and tireless labor of 
the proud scientists of Grandiga and Soleil

00:10:04.960 --> 00:10:06.370
has at last borne fruit!

00:10:07.310 --> 00:10:09.760
The birth of this new chrars 
will serve as a beacon of hope

00:10:09.760 --> 00:10:11.630
to those of us living now,

00:10:11.630 --> 00:10:16.040
and to our children in the future!

00:10:17.810 --> 00:10:22.930
<i>Let us take this opportunity to deepen 
the friendship between our countries,</i>

00:10:18.420 --> 00:10:22.250
<i>As an analyst, I was there with my husband</i>

00:10:22.250 --> 00:10:25.850
<i>to attend the ceremony and 
witness the operations test.</i>

00:10:22.930 --> 00:10:25.850
<i>work together in various enterprises,</i>

00:10:26.080 --> 00:10:30.540
<i>and bring greater prosperity to our 
world and those who live there!</i>

00:10:28.470 --> 00:10:30.230
<i>It all happened so suddenly.</i>

00:10:38.440 --> 00:10:39.480
Who are you?

00:10:39.870 --> 00:10:42.780
We've planted bombs in 
the hall and on the device.

00:10:43.350 --> 00:10:45.290
I don't want to take innocent lives.

00:10:45.740 --> 00:10:47.370
Dismantle the new chrars.

00:10:47.720 --> 00:10:50.170
That power doesn't belong in this world!

00:11:04.220 --> 00:11:04.850
Dear!

00:11:43.160 --> 00:11:44.130
S... St...

00:11:59.730 --> 00:12:01.000
Get out of the way!

00:12:01.940 --> 00:12:04.070
We're in a hurry! Bring her in!

00:12:13.410 --> 00:12:15.080
You're going to be all right.

00:12:16.130 --> 00:12:17.200
She's regaining consciousness.

00:12:17.200 --> 00:12:20.280
Pulse rate 50. Blood pressure 95 over 65.

00:12:20.280 --> 00:12:22.520
No sign of cyanosis. Breathing is stable.

00:12:22.520 --> 00:12:25.110
PVR has risen to normal levels.

00:12:25.690 --> 00:12:26.590
Princess Yuki!

00:12:26.590 --> 00:12:29.100
Don't worry. The princess is unharmed.

00:12:38.580 --> 00:12:42.360
<i>I awoke one month later.</i>

00:12:42.690 --> 00:12:45.050
<i>While I was in a coma,</i>

00:12:45.050 --> 00:12:48.570
<i>the Kingdom of Soleil had censured 
the Empire of Grandiga with a claim</i>

00:12:48.570 --> 00:12:53.870
<i>that the king's death was the result of 
the Imperial Army's reckless behavior.</i>

00:12:54.350 --> 00:12:57.980
<i>Diplomatic relations between the 
countries were severed as a result.</i>

00:12:58.490 --> 00:12:59.600
Ms. Étoile.

00:13:01.720 --> 00:13:04.450
We've accounted for everyone 
who returned safely.

00:13:04.450 --> 00:13:07.800
This is the list of those presumed dead.

00:13:19.990 --> 00:13:24.730
<i>And so, I lost my family, my home...</i>

00:13:25.410 --> 00:13:27.240
<i>everything.</i>

00:13:35.270 --> 00:13:38.020
How are you feeling?

00:13:38.020 --> 00:13:39.290
Better...

00:13:39.830 --> 00:13:45.080
I invited you here to thank you, Ms. Étoile.

00:13:48.330 --> 00:13:50.000
Do you remember her?

00:13:50.520 --> 00:13:52.060
That girl...

00:13:52.060 --> 00:13:57.390
That is the daughter of the late 
royal couple, Princess Yuki Soleil.

00:13:59.250 --> 00:14:00.690
Princess... Yuki...

00:14:01.380 --> 00:14:05.250
If you hadn't protected her, 
she would be dead now.

00:14:11.360 --> 00:14:15.010
C'mon, Princess Yuki! Bleh!

00:14:16.050 --> 00:14:17.920
Princess Yuki! Princess Yuki!

00:14:18.680 --> 00:14:22.420
No one knows what to do 
when she gets like this.

00:14:59.430 --> 00:15:04.130
<i>From that day forward, 
I would serve Princess Yuki.</i>

00:15:10.410 --> 00:15:11.740
Miss Layla...

00:15:11.740 --> 00:15:13.970
Princess Yuki, I request that you change.

00:15:18.880 --> 00:15:20.620
Hey, Miss Layla...

00:15:20.620 --> 00:15:21.470
Yes?

00:15:21.470 --> 00:15:27.040
Did you know that Joshua and I used 
to sneak out together like this?

00:15:27.040 --> 00:15:29.590
Did you truly think that I wouldn't notice?

00:15:36.050 --> 00:15:39.650
I wonder what Father and 
Mother would think...

00:15:40.130 --> 00:15:42.300
if they heard about the State of Caldarth.

00:15:43.060 --> 00:15:48.030
You chose the lives of your people 
over your personal feelings.

00:15:48.570 --> 00:15:52.220
I'm sure they would be proud.

00:15:53.490 --> 00:15:55.320
I feel the same way.

00:15:56.050 --> 00:15:56.890
Really?

00:15:57.420 --> 00:16:01.140
Yes. You are a worthy princess of Soleil.

00:16:03.790 --> 00:16:05.060
That's right...

00:16:05.640 --> 00:16:07.150
I am the princess, aren't I?

00:16:08.650 --> 00:16:10.860
Thank you, Miss Layla.

00:16:15.600 --> 00:16:18.000
The evacuation of the state 
is almost complete.

00:16:18.000 --> 00:16:19.540
Leash is the last location left.

00:16:20.010 --> 00:16:23.060
Evacuation should be complete by 1100 hours.

00:16:23.060 --> 00:16:23.960
Good.

00:16:25.580 --> 00:16:26.640
Princess Yuki!

00:16:30.100 --> 00:16:33.680
As princess, I thought 
I should see this for myself...

00:16:40.340 --> 00:16:43.560
Princess Yuki, about Joshua...

00:16:44.360 --> 00:16:46.690
I understand why you did it.

00:16:48.240 --> 00:16:49.910
I cannot apologize enough.

00:16:52.140 --> 00:16:54.070
How are the evacuations coming along?

00:16:54.070 --> 00:16:57.320
Right. It's all proceeding smoothly.

00:16:58.940 --> 00:16:59.830
I see...

00:17:00.230 --> 00:17:02.130
The evacuation of Leash is complete!

00:17:03.410 --> 00:17:05.240
Put us through to the Excessarca!

00:17:05.240 --> 00:17:06.330
Yes, sir.

00:17:07.180 --> 00:17:10.190
James, you've bought us the time we needed.

00:17:10.190 --> 00:17:11.650
Pull the line back now.

00:17:12.430 --> 00:17:13.550
<i>Yes, sir.</i>

00:17:13.550 --> 00:17:17.840
<i>We'll join up with the evacuation 
forces and build a defense line.</i>

00:17:18.530 --> 00:17:21.890
Theurgears with minor damage: 358.

00:17:21.890 --> 00:17:23.460
Moderate damage: 126.

00:17:23.460 --> 00:17:24.850
Major damage: zero.

00:17:24.850 --> 00:17:27.260
Those mounted with the new chrars 
are all in good condition.

00:17:28.800 --> 00:17:30.530
The new chrars?

00:17:31.980 --> 00:17:33.490
Please, forgive me.

00:17:34.120 --> 00:17:37.610
I installed the new chrars 
without your permission.

00:17:38.780 --> 00:17:39.870
Why?!

00:17:40.080 --> 00:17:45.320
To hold the enemy back until 
evacuations were complete,

00:17:45.320 --> 00:17:48.830
our forces needed the 
power of the new chrars.

00:17:49.730 --> 00:17:51.300
I'm the one who recommended it.

00:17:51.700 --> 00:17:54.090
I'll accept any punishment 
you feel appropriate.

00:18:00.030 --> 00:18:05.460
It was the new chrars that allowed 
everyone evacuate safely...

00:18:06.650 --> 00:18:08.020
Is that correct?

00:18:08.020 --> 00:18:08.940
Yes.

00:18:08.940 --> 00:18:10.430
That much is indisputable.

00:18:13.490 --> 00:18:14.610
Very well.

00:18:15.220 --> 00:18:18.110
But from now on, you are 
to report everything to me.

00:18:18.250 --> 00:18:19.040
Yes, ma'am.

00:18:20.330 --> 00:18:22.370
Urgent message from the recon unit in Leash!

00:18:31.430 --> 00:18:32.880
What's going on here?

00:18:33.150 --> 00:18:36.130
We're not giving our city up without a fight!

00:18:36.890 --> 00:18:41.510
This is where our families 
died wishing for peace!

00:18:41.880 --> 00:18:44.610
Harold, we need to save those people!

00:18:44.610 --> 00:18:47.410
The Imperial Army is right on top of them.

00:18:47.410 --> 00:18:48.890
If we fight now, they'll all—

00:18:48.890 --> 00:18:50.620
I don't want you to fight!

00:18:50.620 --> 00:18:51.770
I want you to <i>save them</i>!

00:18:53.530 --> 00:18:58.740
You said you used the new chrars to 
keep anyone else from dying, right?

00:18:59.540 --> 00:19:01.920
I don't want anyone else to die!

00:19:01.920 --> 00:19:02.870
Please!

00:19:05.810 --> 00:19:09.370
Larva Unit! Head back to Leash! 
Pick up those civilians!

00:19:17.880 --> 00:19:20.550
Kingdom of Soleil, be eternal!

00:19:27.140 --> 00:19:28.220
We made it!

00:19:28.550 --> 00:19:29.730
Get them in! Hurry!

00:19:32.980 --> 00:19:34.430
Imperial theurgears approaching!

00:19:34.430 --> 00:19:35.810
I estimate twenty!

00:19:39.700 --> 00:19:40.990
We have the civilians!

00:19:41.270 --> 00:19:42.650
Get out of there right now!

00:19:42.650 --> 00:19:43.870
Hurry!

00:20:02.670 --> 00:20:04.700
Two Larva Unit machines have 
sustained major damage!

00:20:05.930 --> 00:20:08.420
More imperial theurgears are coming!

00:20:17.750 --> 00:20:21.450
Grand Master Harold! Captain James 
requests permission to engage!

00:20:21.450 --> 00:20:22.990
No! I won't permit it!

00:20:23.250 --> 00:20:25.280
Why not, Harold?!

00:20:25.280 --> 00:20:29.380
If we send reinforcements now, 
it will only exacerbate our losses!

00:20:29.380 --> 00:20:31.430
We can't afford to lose the Excessarca, too!

00:20:31.430 --> 00:20:33.000
But if we don't...

00:20:34.560 --> 00:20:36.500
Harold! Please!

00:20:38.910 --> 00:20:40.760
Please, get away!

00:21:09.720 --> 00:21:10.830
Why...

00:21:12.770 --> 00:21:15.610
This is the nature of war.

00:21:19.580 --> 00:21:23.550
I just... I just wanted...

00:23:06.510 --> 00:23:08.650
<i>Site to command. Site to command.</i>

00:23:09.030 --> 00:23:11.630
<i>This is the O'Lissetta Area Army.</i>

00:23:11.630 --> 00:23:13.880
<i>Our defensive line has been breached!</i>

